#: ../../tools/mydisease_tools.rst:32 6ebba5521231412a8948fc4a63baeab8
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get comprehensive disease annotations from "
"MyDisease.info, a BioThings disease aggregator that integrates data from "
"MONDO, Disease Ontology, CTD (chemicals and pathways related to disease),"
" HPO (phenotypes), and DisGeNET (gene-disease associations). Returns "
"standardized disease identifiers, definitions, cross-references, "
"associated chemicals, pathways, and phenotypes. Example: MONDO:0005148 "
"(type 2 diabetes) returns 160 CTD chemicals, 984 related pathways, and 3 "
"HPO phenotypes including late onset and autosomal dominant inheritance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/mydisease_tools.rst:34 ../../tools/mydisease_tools.rst:68
#: 1eb6cdb85b4441a6b7a8cf5b738a628a 9dec05c32173458987e308001daa0cee
msgid "**Parameters:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/mydisease_tools.rst:36 2ced8f9c4fbb4c7baae6d85bb82bac66
msgid ""
"``disease_id`` (string) (required) Disease identifier. Supports MONDO IDs"
" (e.g., 'MONDO:0005148' for T2DM), DOID IDs (e.g., 'DOID:9352'), OMIM IDs"
" (e.g., 'OMIM:125853'), or MESH IDs (e.g., 'MESH:D003924'). MONDO IDs "
"provide the most comprehensive results."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/mydisease_tools.rst:39 ae5f968972b4478bac0eaa229e982f5d
msgid ""
"``fields`` (string) (optional) Comma-separated list of data fields to "
"return. Options: 'mondo', 'disease\\_ontology', 'ctd', 'hpo', 'disgenet',"
" 'all'. Default: 'mondo,disease\\_ontology,ctd,hpo'. Use 'all' for "
"complete data."
msgstr ""

